OL,3,ASoftware glitch caused travel chaos,
OL,4,Asays air traffic control body
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air traffic control system failure
OL,7,Fthat sparked widespread travel chaos
OL,8,Fearlier this month was caused by a
OL,9,F"software defect", the UK's National
OL,10,FAir Traffic Services (Nats) has said.
OL,12,FThe failure led to more than 2,000
OL,13,Fflights being cancelled and hundreds of
OL,14,Fthousands of passengers affected, with
OL,15,Fsome sleeping on airport floors or
OL,16,Fgetting stuck overseas.
OL,18,FFlights in and out of the UK's main
OL,19,Fairports were affected, including
OL,20,FHeathrow, Gatwick, Luton and Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
